OL,3,GNEWSAMan who created indecent AI images
OL,4,Aof girls jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man used artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,7,Fplatforms to create indecent images of
OL,8,Fwomen and girls, Staffordshire Police
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FLewis Davison, 26, from Lichfield
OL,12,Fposted a series of AI-generated
OL,13,Fpornographic images on closed Telegram
OL,14,Fgroups.
OL,16,FIn some captions on the social media
OL,17,Fmessaging app, he called for the women
OL,18,Fdepicted in the images to be raped and
OL,19,Fassaulted, investigators found.
